    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳位置划分一年。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the year by the Sun's position."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "芒种是第九个节气。太阳到达黄经75°，\"芒\"指麦子有芒，\"种\"指该播种了。",
        "en": "Mangzhong is the ninth term: the Sun reaches 75°. \"Mang\" means bearded grains; \"zhong\" means it's time to plant."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017/2024年机构稿沿用同一表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-mangzhong-feature",
        "source-xinhua-mangzhong-2024"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-mangzhong-longitude-75"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "芒种是农历五月的\"节\"。名字的意思是\"有芒的麦子快收，有芒的稻子可种\"。",
        "en": "Mangzhong is the node term of the fifth lunar month. Its name means \"harvest bearded wheat, plant bearded rice.\""
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（传统历法编算规则）"
      ],
      "period": "现行农历编算口径；GB/T 33661-2017 为现行国家标准（正文条款待人工核读）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-yueling-qishierhou-wikisource"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-jieqi-zhongqi"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "梅雨季节开始。收麦子和插秧同时进行，是农民最忙的时候。",
        "en": "The plum rain season begins. Wheat harvest and rice transplanting overlap — the busiest farming period."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国东部季风区（机构稿为全国综述，梅雨段限长江中下游）"
      ],
      "period": "现代气象口径；2024年国家气候中心监测为数据样本",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-mangzhong-feature",
        "source-xinhua-mangzhong-2024"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-mangzhong-sanxia-meiyu"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c5",
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "古人观察到：螳螂孵化了、伯劳鸟开始叫、反舌鸟不叫了。",
        "en": "Ancient texts: mantises hatch, shrikes begin to sing, mockingbirds fall silent."
      },
      "region": [
        "文本经验锚定中国（黄河流域为核心的古典物候传统）；实际物候因纬度海拔而异"
      ],
      "period": "文本传统题名为元代（吴澄）；所承物候体系更早（《礼记·月令》《吕氏春秋》等）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-yueling-qishierhou-wikisource",
        "source-ihchina-mangzhong-feature"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "hist-yueling-mangzhong-pentads"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "mangzhong-c6",
      "kind": "tradition",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "农民忙着收麦、插秧，是一年中最忙的农时。",
        "en": "Farmers harvest wheat and transplant rice — the busiest agricultural season."
      },
      "region": [
        "皖南（安苗）；贵州东南部（打泥巴仗）；南方梅子产区（煮梅）"
      ],
      "period": "安苗\"始于明初\"为非遗网断言（无出处）；余为当代记载，断代未证",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-mangzhong-feature"
